      "officialTitle": "A Two-Part First-in-Human Study to Assess the Safety, Tolerability, Pharmacokinetics and Pharmacodynamics of Single and Multiple Ascending Subcutaneous Doses of GUB014295 in Lean to Overweight or Obese But Otherwise Healthy Men and Women",
      "registryIdentifiers": [
        {
          "registry": "ClinicalTrials.gov",
          "id": "NCT06144684"
        }
      ],
      "protocolIdentifiers": [
        "GUC17-01",
